id: pm-native-index-proof
title: Bound independent native receipt regression cases
description: "Two compound native receipt keepers exceed their unchanged 30000ms test deadlines: indexed proof in Windows shard1 run40837931196 and cross-worktree receipt settlement in Windows shard3 run40864851705. Separate independent contracts while preserving real Git boundaries, all refusal/preservation/retry assertions, serial allocation, retries and deadlines."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-29T08:28:14.112Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-29T18:10:22.020Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-29T18:10:21.116Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-29T18:10:21.116Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Retain every indexed-proof and worktree-settlement assertion with same-fixture recovery and idempotence; Separate independent cases without extending deadlines or weakening coverage; Pass the complete affected Windows shard1 and shard3 cohorts
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Require the stage=true refusal to identify unstaged reconciliation paths, while retaining all independent indexed-proof and history-preservation assertions."
expected_result: The actual sandboxed portability suite passes and staging refusal identifies its unstaged-edit cause.
actual_result: "After confirming absent lease ownership and consumers, preserving the old lease and rebuilding, the linked real-Git portability command completed successfully with exit0. Earlier refused execution and evidence correction remain in immutable history."
